Added ask to exit if you press escape in the game.
Switched to new server.
Installs keyhook.
New in 1.01
Added stun darts! These items when used will be thrown in the direction you're facing. If they hit someone, they will be zapped and cannot move for five seconds!
Updated remote gun sounds.
Slightly updated readme.txt
Added a tracking menu and tracking system.
Fixed an annoying problem that would make your char log in like 20 times.
New in 1.0
Started to work on a propper readme!
Changed to a new server.
Fixed poisonstars.
Ultrabombs now only take 20 coins to explode.
Added ultrabombs! These extremely powerful bombs will explode the entire map! I hope you have a lot of health or plenty of antibiotics...
Added a coin system! These coins will be used to get an ultrabomb going, and more to come!
Modified inventory menu, press shift enter on an item and you'll use said item with out leaving the menu.
Fixed a bug that would allow you to exit the game and double your inventory.
Fixed bugs with the inventory clicks not playing propperly.
Added option in the options menu to force the game to check for updates.
Added a new options menu.
Redesigned Main menu.
Added a new visual mode(buggy though)
Fixes problems with mines.
finally, thank god, fixed the exit bug. now if the server crashes it will exit in 2 seconds.
Hopefully reduced a lot of lag with updated classes, less server work, etc.
Added a key to turn off your beacons. Press F3.
Added PM's to the game. 
New in 0.5
Removed server versioning.
Added fists.
Added poison stars! throw one and it will go after the closest player. If hit, they will start walking slower and slower, and they'll start losing health. Lets hope they have a lot of health, and we better hope that no one is near them, well, they have a better chance of attacking that player and after a while, they'll collapse and get knocked out for 45 seconds! While you're knocked out, you won't be able to move, and you may or not be able to hear what's around!
Added mines! Step on one  and you're damn fucked. A mine will take anywhere from 200 to 800 health. Be careful...
Items now have a timeout of2 minutes.
Items can and will break if you shoot them. So, be careful!
AI is now much smarter and will select a random player.
Added a key to check how many enemies are on the map. Press E to check, and the server will tell you how many enemies are after you, and how many enemies are after other players.
Added admins to the game.
Added a new menu to copy a player's name to the clipboard. Press f5 to access this menu.
Fixed bugs with remote guns not dieing when they should.
Improved moving system, and freed a lot of server lag.
Added online AI, so if you're online and there's no one on, go ahead and gain more kills by killing AI players. Its great for practicing!
New in 0.4
Added remote controled guns! When you have one, press enter on it in your inventory and watch as you place it! When it is set, you can press shift+R to use your controler. After this, you can press space to fire your gun, which should blast anyone with in a radius of 15 feet! Press escape to put the controler away.
Added antibiotics, take one and you'll slowly but surely start getting more and more health!
Added Timebombs! Activate one, and it will start counting down. Once the time is up, the bomb will explode and start causing some dammage to players that are in 25 feet from the bomb! So, you hear a beep getting faster and faster, you better hope you're fast enough or you'll get blown up to bits!
Added Horns, perfect for annoying the hell out of people and getting people to want to blow you up!
Added invisibility shields. Activate one and you will be invisible for 30 seconds.
Added an inventory along with items.
Added f4: checks server version.
Updated readme to reflect changes in the latest few versions.
Made it so your right shift key stops doing that uncontrolably fast sound.
New in 0.31
Added more weapons.
Changed the walking keys back to what they were.
Now you turn with shift and left and right.
Updated the mPro class.
New in 0.3
Made it so you walk with a,s,d,w and you can turn now with left and right.
Fixed admin bug.
Fixed a few bugs in the updater.
Added pinging, hit f3 and get your ping results!
Made the game not be able to run multiple times. No more coming online with 300000 instances of your char!
